{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blitz Arena is a competitive and dynamic PARTY GAME shooter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a tournament with 8 players in a multitude of game modes to emerge victorious. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alone or in a team, prepare yourself for versus, battle royale, dodgeball, gun games and several other game modes... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to finish as high as possible to earn points on each mode to win the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>// Features //</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 Gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 Maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Free unlockable skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 grenades</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>// Gamemodes //</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tournament 1v1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/extras/Tournament.gif?t=1739467901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All players compete in a 1v1 tournament table (Upper and loser bracket). The objective is to finish as high as possible in the tournament to collect points.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gungame</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/extras/GUNGAME.gif?t=1739467901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>  </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do kills to level up and change weapons, the first team to complete all levels wins the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dodge ball</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/extras/Dodgeball.gif?t=1739467901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play ping-pong with remote-controlled rockets, throw rocket on your enemies with your gun! Be careful, the rocket speeds up with each dodge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elimination confirm\u00e9</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/extras/killconfirm.gif?t=1739467901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do kills and collect enemy soul, the first team to reach 30 enemy souls collected wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Battle Royal</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/extras/BR.gif?t=1739467901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Jump out of the plane, find loots, prepare yourself for the final fight but be careful, the area moves very quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>Aim target</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/extras/AimTarget.gif?t=1739467901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 3 rounds with different speeds, shoot as many targets as possible to earn points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Runner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/extras/RUNNER.gif?t=1739467901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the parcours as quickly as possible while shooting at the targets. Don't miss one, otherwise a penalty will be given to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And much more to discover...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/extras/map.gif?t=1739467901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2727490?t=1739467901","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2727490?t=1739467901","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739467901","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739467901","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"demos":[{"appid":2837940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blitz Arena is a competitive and dynamic PARTY GAME shooter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a tournament with 8 players in a multitude of game modes to emerge victorious. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alone or in a team, prepare yourself for versus, battle royale, dodgeball, gun games and several other game modes... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to finish as high as possible to earn points on each mode to win the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>// Features //</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 Gamemodes</p></li